<title>INDIA: Hoechst AG to hike stake in India unit.</title>
<headline>Hoechst AG to hike stake in India unit.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian government has granted permission to German chemicals group Hoechst AG to raise its stake in Hoechst Marion Roussel Ltd, a local subsidiary, a company official said on Friday.</p>
</text>
